  m_text: "MISSION NOTE\n\r\nThere is a way out\u2026 but not the way you think.\r\n\r\n1.
    Search where knowledge is kept \u2014 the answers are hidden there\r\n2. Find
    what unlocks what should never be opened\r\n3. Go to the room that feels\u2026
    wrong\r\n4. Break what keeps this place alive\r\n5. Find the path above everything\r\n6.
    End it\u2026 before it ends you\r\n\r\nOnly then\u2026 you might see the exit.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t
    trust the silence.\r\nAnd whatever you do\u2026 don\u2019t lose track of it.\r\n"
